{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You work for <strong>SQUARS Corporation</strong> \u2013 a galactic megacorporation extracting resources from planets. However, the planet you've been assigned turns out to be extremely problematic to exploit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll need to use every possible strategy to complete your mission!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Unique Tower Defense<strong>:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build towers to stop incoming hordes of enemies \u2013 but be careful!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every structure you place can be destroyed, so plan wisely where to position your walls,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >generators, and defenses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547120/extras/0285cfba654fe4816ffe4e8cb6d96d70.poster.avif?t=1756040182\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547120/extras/0285cfba654fe4816ffe4e8cb6d96d70.webm?t=1756040182\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547120/extras/0285cfba654fe4816ffe4e8cb6d96d70.mp4?t=1756040182\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Roguelite Twist<strong>:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run starts with a limited arsenal, which expands randomly</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >by drawing cards from a deck you build between sessions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomized maps bring a variety of unique enemy combinations,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and the credits and experience you earn will unlock powerful upgrades between runs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547120/extras/c8de8ea268e58557b1b53856e6348cfd.poster.avif?t=1756040182\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547120/extras/c8de8ea268e58557b1b53856e6348cfd.webm?t=1756040182\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547120/extras/c8de8ea268e58557b1b53856e6348cfd.mp4?t=1756040182\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Day &amp; Night Cycle<strong>:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catch your breath during the day and prepare to survive longer, more difficult nights</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >when hordes of square-shaped enemies awaken!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Tribute to Clickers<strong>:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Squars </strong>offers a more active gameplay style for players who like to take matters into their own cursors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click on enemies to crush them, unleash devastating abilities,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >boost your click power and limits, and manually repair buildings that need support.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547120/extras/a778150bcbf1457f2b36cdebe99183b9.poster.avif?t=1756040182\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547120/extras/a778150bcbf1457f2b36cdebe99183b9.webm?t=1756040182\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547120/extras/a778150bcbf1457f2b36cdebe99183b9.mp4?t=1756040182\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Act during Pause<strong>:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speed up gameplay up to five times, and pause at any time to build, use abilities,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and survey the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547120/extras/c52caae8c867a6a4b9cd4743685646e9.poster.avif?t=1756040182\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547120/extras/c52caae8c867a6a4b9cd4743685646e9.webm?t=1756040182\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547120/extras/c52caae8c867a6a4b9cd4743685646e9.mp4?t=1756040182\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Remember \u2013 Everything is a Square<strong>:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Squars</strong>, there's no room for other shapes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything \u2013 from buildings and enemies to weapon ranges and UI \u2013 is square.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yes, even the pixels in the visual effects count!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Playable Demo coming soon<strong>:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click on &quot;Visit the website&quot; to play <strong>Legacy Version</strong> available on itch.io!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the meantime, please support the project by <strong>wishlisting</strong>!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547120/extras/c9de18915547fe4711ff3a514c231771.poster.avif?t=1756040182\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547120/extras/c9de18915547fe4711ff3a514c231771.webm?t=1756040182\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547120/extras/c9de18915547fe4711ff3a514c231771.mp4?t=1756040182\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p 